c Rain and a sprinkler, either of which wets the grass.
c x1: it rained. x2: the sprinkler ran. x3: the grass is wet.
c It rains with probability 0.2 and the sprinkler runs with probability 0.4.
c The grass is wet exactly when one of them happened, so x3 weighs 1 either
c way and the weighted count is 1.
c t wmc
p cnf 3 3
c p weight 1 0.2 0
c p weight 2 0.4 0
-1 3 0
-2 3 0
1 2 -3 0
